    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκοντ-ιστήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιστής</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				142
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
			Adj., <i>darting, hurtling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίαινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					5.535
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαζοὶ ἀ. ἐρώτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					7.264
				</span></i>
			:—also in pass. sense, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρσος, λᾶας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				24.134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				30.230
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκοντιστῆρες μόλυβοι</span>
			prob. <i>bullets</i>, Keil-Premerstein <i>Dritter Bericht</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				p.89
			</span></i>.</div>
